:: Ask Aiden what he is preparing for {"position":"675,650","size":"100,100"}
<i>
              "What are you preparing for Aiden"
          
          Aiden:
               "Well some last minute meeting was called by our father with me and some random others. You know that is how our King is. I wasn't sure I was going, but the servant that told our father seemed serious. "
               
               "Serious? What is he talking about."
               
 Aiden leans in closer to you. 
 
          Aiden:
               "I don't know really, but the servants who told me seemed a little spooked. "
               
               "Spooked???"
               
          Aiden:
               "Yeh. Oh man wait. I am going to be late. I told Sofia I met her there early as well. I have to go now. Don't think about it too much , kid. I am sure its no big deal"
    
Aiden heads out.

[[Hey wait]]

[[Let him go]]
    
</i>


