:: Begin [crazy] {"position":"250,250","size":"100,100"}
<i>

<p>
**KNOCK KNOCK**

<span style="color:#d9b3ff">

You </span> jump up out of bed with excitement.

       "What is it Felix . Anything special is happening today. Anything you need help with."
       
        Felix:
       			" Yes my prince, just reminding everyone that the celebration breakfast is starting soon. It won't be the same without everyone being there."
       
       You:
              "Ok Ok, of course I will be there Felix, but it is not for another hour. I am glad that you are excited. Is there anything else special event happening today?"
        
        Felix:
             "Who wouldn't be excited today, I know you are. Plus I am always excited to serve in this household my prince. And no other special event besides going to the King's chamber as well today. I think though I heard your sisters and brothers want to see you later today again as well..
<<linkreplace "continue">>
 <p>              "Oh everybody will be at the King's throne hall today. Though what do my siblings want? I am seeing them at breakfest, what more is it."
 
         You:
              " I wouldn't know, you would have to ask them, they all seemed really excited talking about it."      
              
<span style="color:#d9b3ff">
You </span>snicker.
        
        You:
             "Well, I will dismiss you Filex, Thank You. Happy Alabaster day!"
             
             Felix:
                  "Happy Alabaster day, my prince. Allow me to take my leave."
                  
Felix walks away as <span style="color:#d9b3ff">You</span> wave him goodbye. 
             
[[Take time getting ready]]

[[Head to the banquet early]]
</p>
<</linkreplace>>
</p>
</i>


:: Chapter 2 [\[\[feast\]\]] {"position":"1375,100","size":"100,100"}
After the battle people are still looking at you strange. When you return there is a feast for you and your siblings victory in battle. During the feast you see the sibiling you saved whisper soemthing in the kings ear. You feel uneasy, with you yourself not knowing what just happened. After the feast, you go to return to your chambers. Though the sibling you saved wants to have a word with you?

Sibling 1: "Hey we all just wanted to thank you for today, come with me we have a gift for you. We all decided to host you a celebration in the courtyard"


