:: Eat {"position":"250,1025","size":"100,100"}
<i>

The power of food stops everything. Frank is too busy stuffing his face to talk. <span style="color:#d9b3ff">You</span> eat with your family. There is nothing more wholesome and nothing more beautiful. Everyone one of you are a foodie. You look around the table at everyone in happiness. This is what matters.  Nothing else. Felix walks in with some other servents to help pour wine into everyone's glass.

        Felix:
             "Happy Alabaster Day!!! I would like to thank you all for joining. I know your King would be proud. To the 20th anniversary of the founding of the Alabaster kingdom. Let them have a long rule. Cheers.""
             
Everyone cheers and applauses, and the room breaks into laughter and joy. After everyone is done eating one of your sisters comes up to you. She gives you a big hug.

         Ania:
              "I will be seeing you later today ok. Meet us in the courtyard. We will all be there to have some fun activities for today. Isn't that right Frank?"
         
Frank looks up nodding really fast with all the food in his mouth. He can't utter complete sentences. 

          Frank:
               "Looks up yeh, yeh, I forgot. See yall there"
               
<span style="color:#d9b3ff">You</span> look at Ania with excitement. Ok see everyone [[later tonight then]].
              
                  
</i>


