:: intro [Intro] {"position":"125,375","size":"100,100"}
<i>

<p id="p1">
Alabaster is a kingdom that has brought prosperity to the land. All the books and records of the previous kingdom don't exist. Though it is said that the previous kingdom rule led the land into ruin.  It has been 20 years since the reign of Alabaster started. Most of the continent has united under Alabaster for peace and to rebuild/recover from whatever devastation that occurred under the <<link "previous kingdom rule.">><<run $("#p2").addClass("show")>><</link>>
</p><p id="p2" class="fadein">
Alabaster has very advanced technology beyond the current times, though they still rule humbly and the people live in a flux of technology and land. Certain parts of the country are still <<link "unstable.">><<run $("#p3").addClass("show")>><</link>>
</p><p id="p3" class="fadein"><span style="color:#d9b3ff">
You </span>live in the heart of Alabaster in one the royal places as one of many siblings that are all heirs to the throne. Even though you have different mothers they are all close family fighting for what is right and<span style="color:#d9b3ff"> You </span>love them all. 

[[Begin]]
</p>
 </i>


